OL,3,GNEWSAThe 101-year-old who is older than
OL,4,Athe place where she lives
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I look back sometimes with pride
OL,7,Freally," said mum-of-three Kathleen as
OL,8,Fshe reflected fondly on the last 70
OL,9,Fyears.
